@startuml scrum_cycle
title The Scrum cycle

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontColor #333333
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor        #FFFFFF
  BorderColor            #808080
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor     #808080
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam noteBorderColor     #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteFontSize        10

start
:Product backlog
(prioritised requirements);

repeat
  :Sprint planning
— select the items of the iteration;
  :Sprint backlog;
  :Daily work
(daily scrum, development, testing);
  :Increment
(potentially shippable);
  :Sprint review
— demonstrate the increment;
  :Sprint retrospective
— adapt the way of working;
repeat while (items left in the product backlog?) is (yes) not (no)

stop

note right
  Iterations of a fixed length. Each one starts from the
  product backlog and ends with an increment that can be
  shown; adaptation happens between iterations, not inside.
end note

@enduml
